{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:36ced3a49d01f10ed1210e58b630dc61828e62b308edded5d36f083a058f01f8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d81a0dd96ed60bb025cbf3ff995b5a95f9ecd665e9de12281006e334be14b43c",
      "text": "将心意寄托于无二的色彩",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:233a046c0a5b2246abb704875e119e19a9f1430abbeb4d3c30d0e5d467a69391",
      "text": "恭二和皮埃尔向实询问生日想要什么礼物。然而得到的回答却是“什么我都高兴”，这让两人犯了愁。在与制作人商量后，皮埃尔和恭二准备的礼物究竟是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000016:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000016:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d81a0dd96ed60bb025cbf3ff995b5a95f9ecd665e9de12281006e334be14b43c",
      "text": "将心意寄托于无二的色彩",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad47635be7fcaf5feda4a55f91e7ed9cfb83f15e250d46f23f547265985d0295",
      "text": "把这边这样弄一下的话……如何？\n……平衡感不太好啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3a6b2813c92226cd8953161e649222b7d407f3fcb39238f0287b194bc8dc29f",
      "text": "哈啊。\n插花这玩意儿，还挺难的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd2af89dadeecc9e1a7e1c1f22593539e4592289f7cd6800aa62bfc0cc33ce62",
      "text": "（虽然早就料到了，\n但确实没法做得像实先生那样好啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1175b69ccb750f7db6d1d71446706b91a1a20cd80392ae08c96a9c5bc221dd13",
      "text": "做好了！恭二，你看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf28f228288c236590156ea6aa9ee417e58e5a9ad74e75f987de6f048f00105e",
      "text": "大花花，为了显眼，小花花也放一起。\n怎么样，漂亮吗？实，会高兴吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a20673ecfbc4865c6656f379d390012d5ef3e36a8a74c05221c7c0f4708fa3",
      "text": "啊啊。\n皮埃尔果然手巧啊，做得很好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5edd9839bfebbe3dee0948b4abc85341304663987262e966a0517debed931a98",
      "text": "平衡感很棒。\n而且看着就很有皮埃尔的风格。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:977eb8ae78ee2d4cdd7ac42f5440fc187d300067576e0b77acb7c3a456396c1d",
      "text": "呀呼——！谢谢。恭二的花也很漂亮，对吧！\n实绝对会高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ede351e5182cd1f138483d3fd07d052cd275bff9be171dc59bf591214d13ea9e",
      "text": "哈哈，谢了。\n在实先生生日之前，必须好好加油练习了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3252d42ce779941bf4f8a1b879ced456f93f1989f7337d1833d93be5b5642d16",
      "text": "嗯。能让实露出好多笑容的、\n漂亮的花花，一起做吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_b:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "几天前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9765b25ed165b5e9e184505e6af90e893dd930494d5ea18ff1bf45cec16b6f43",
      "text": "实先生，马上就要到您生日了吧。\n有什么想要的东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e74cfe765c1e8fa919c928826ee8a3f291c5dd6fff0eb14ec5cccfd8e191a400",
      "text": "我们，要给实庆祝。\n想送实会开心的东西！告诉我嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:389973114451bdf239129d8bd7f2877413bc52f5fb2b82b76f4eb8ead27be392",
      "text": "不用那么破费啦。\n不过还是谢谢你们，两个人都是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13346ffb48ed5993a58909fa8a46e525af8b161eb24ab86455a0f31399555861",
      "text": "没有什么想要的吗？\n虽然太贵的东西可能有点悬就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec6287b6ebbbff5e7588e1def26991ce28cdd47927c5cc3bee90c2d22b7228a9",
      "text": "嗯……说的也是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b291a2743b57116677f0c6d6884da8c7bf06a2faac978e227ed95e0a7c7d5c7",
      "text": "只要是你们两个人送的，我什么都高兴哦。\n光是刚才那番对话，就已经让我很开心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9fc52d77e746c695bef44fb1e8cbdab63b83bb1caac4fecf570563f201df44d",
      "text": "那样的话，要让实更加开心！\n恭二，生日，加油吧——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10c797a008e7a602097ee274d003e443ceaac78c6a15197567b44029d189cd89",
      "text": "谢谢你们两个。\n我很期待生日那天哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08ef67a8e13b37f5dbdda8903ddfbc89647a0efdcab45131f4a692441da2ad14",
      "text": "挑礼物，好兴奋，好开心！\n但是，要想对方想要什么，超级难……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cbb59d391e0c62498afd4e7d6bb1c7f8b473730836750b36a5cd62fe28f41a6",
      "text": "是啊，选吃的吧种类太多，\n选衣服吧又容易变成我们自己喜欢的风格，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:758751e8e8e2486a930abb02b9dc2ff5fb9454870c2c2bbe90837c4a9d5090da",
      "text": "作为最后手段的偶像周边……的话，\n就更难了。可能会买重啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cf014450fb89ea704d6556dd16c772220b1fff56dbaea7e6a03fd43a938a4d9",
      "text": "要挑最适合实的，好难。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0ab287b864163b2ed531412ab760494048e510f9a85e311ba56a051af34fa3b",
      "text": "（恭二先生和皮埃尔先生一脸严肃地在聊着什么……过去打个招呼吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d8199435e35a63f8dfa1b97fc4bccc214f2888398cf57f6b088e4135bf0d5f4",
      "text": "辛苦了！\n你们在聊什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87f57d92cf04f92a7f9be9853cf9f6122be1ee1e50e2a78aa0bcadb98305e633",
      "text": "辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdb4e1dc4dd5d272f5c9ee28b4a38b962fad9b9ba02f0ab5dddad1278406e5f1",
      "text": "实马上就要过生日了！\n我和恭二在找礼物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2896dd94006c621e94aa6238774f2760be112d2c6421b6270866c8215a0b64ad",
      "text": "看了不少东西，但还没定下来到底送什么好。喂，要是换作你，会送什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da0850366029117adeeccbdafbc1974b03c7c74e2a15f2293f78ee832c70e046",
      "text": "原来如此，那确实挺伤脑筋的呢。\n如果是我的话，让我想想……送花吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdb8dc944a67d888571fe6abb4ae4fa3c3784fb1bb40010a42fc1be14a71d364",
      "text": "花吗。送实先生花，\n太理所当然了反而完全没想到啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4667f7171d02ab2bf842903073b220f8889527cc1a26c4521da3d99b53c2299",
      "text": "花花，我觉得很棒！想做世界上独一无二的、\n送给实的礼物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3279deb0a14223c11c8595316642976dfa311177c5dc010d655cd2924b6ac9d",
      "text": "问题是能不能做出够格送给实先生的东西啊。\n这么一想，门槛可真高。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4807be9ff697180864b651edc065d5f7836c8f54e57ced248f29db8d9af97f0",
      "text": "只要是两位亲手制作的花，\n实先生绝对会非常高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20ad42f63ec246f9aa5a9d5caa51f1f35ff9b548bfcd4477b75bea8069f891c0",
      "text": "……也是啊。\n与其在这儿胡思乱想，不如先动手试试看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9fc3d27908c36a2a898c41a5790efc620a677c325cc9eeb8e7fbf6370631637",
      "text": "既然如此，要不要去问问实先生以前打工的那家花店，看能不能请他们帮帮忙呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_c:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ed806d663a4dcbd07908cb6a8efb904fea59f8cdeae8aaeb735208ae7ae06d1",
      "text": "谢谢！\n制作人，拜托——啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbd90826c5a286b77da8532bb8472db14484ec0f72d8e7986f5ec6803b440021",
      "text": "总觉得最近你们两个都很忙呢。\n今天也很匆忙的样子，有好好休息吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da235213820457e52adeb64386372e051581c90ded95709d3929068897235a7b",
      "text": "啊、啊啊。有好好休息啦。\n不过，嘛，就是有点各种各样的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cbe25a4a7018c2e29983b890c948b5a7c1f94247b429c3bdce7f6d50c2bca51",
      "text": "对实要保密。生日那天好好期待哦！\n实，明天见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c88d42a8f533a0d740e0e467d46449760b390c14180f215937503397861b8d3f",
      "text": "……呵呵。\n真让人会心一笑呢，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2c4052dae71fac0dc5142c1fd8eaa48af0155f32062b077759b2913a41d160d",
      "text": "那两个人，好像在为了我的生日\n准备各种各样的东西呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6506a7284b3b5802fe24543578060a48e95d35992541cece0aa105e1d833403",
      "text": "似乎是这样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4514d402fd31651361006369a2587f8f9dbd1da6246fae16bc1e5e4721c1614f",
      "text": "……他们两个之前问过我想要什么呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b11210ea5fc862e95785f4ceeeafd01594e846b5a504c4b74fe40da3e478fe8",
      "text": "那个时候我回答了“只要是你们送的什么都高兴”，\n还在想会不会让他们犯难了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee4bf21eaf7098caf8264f23ed6e09a17a21353bee5011cb33241b50eebb6ced",
      "text": "他们也明白那是实先生的真心话哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:771106e34a8a5d49783c1e0d6333f45b8d76f68ff1b6dbe68d0c0d6a64e82396",
      "text": "嗯。到底在准备什么呢。即使长大成人了，\n也会觉得生日令人期待。这真的很幸福呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:385e61462ef6dfa9b89661f1c27bdbf0c5e248cc912e6d6d13a5294d0e7d2166",
      "text": "生日快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0afb74df0b8cfd52316ed63d94c0f9dda935450378b6e352a6c942d483f87a0a",
      "text": "哇，谢谢你们两个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2f07db18a2a336a7833a322c3005c07adf5557e24c7122be05da761b516c69d",
      "text": "实，这是我们送你的礼物！\n是插花哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f552aa493830a6fe4b2c4071a1c7832c94bff34cb7be7e561c20f62deb94e43",
      "text": "这个是皮埃尔和我一起尝试着做出来的。\n为了练习这个，最近稍微有点忙得团团转……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5acfcae40c6220989b58eda057b02c1f20f076f0073c8ea0c3e1cc8177d86c31",
      "text": "……好厉害。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17387e932d945de112aaacefc177a245eabdb72829f72edb1d6eac849686f809",
      "text": "实哭了。是开心的眼泪吗？\n手帕，要用吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53b884e02dd45371f872603e120acc4170534de9db8955fe16a0166bbcdb1317",
      "text": "……是啊，皮埃尔。手帕，谢谢你。\n这郁金香真漂亮啊。是我的生日花……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec4711ea3c1bd1794ebf3bf3a22eb3d3d65a54dd905de2377058a794314d3403",
      "text": "这是向花店店长请教了建议后挑的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c47acdaaa1b05272e161baf970fa22ec31e19a50dee6347dc296637d2eeafe7",
      "text": "花店的店长，帮了我们好多忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5fdb0e3820dc95c2df3d3e9fd8416a6cc2c68857dc9f7c5265dd5d11d4c642f",
      "text": "说起来，前不久店长还联系过我呢。\n对我说“Beit相处得很融洽呢”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bca05adbe1dd4c1fd8879eee73948ca7fdb8e7ed9fa4083acdaf0dd343209ed",
      "text": "原来是指这件事啊。\n皮埃尔、恭二，真的太谢谢你们了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a2ff5aa01964c8699a238f76689b08f0a6634091bef0e84aa44d11e0858c0a5",
      "text": "哪里，不过是这种程度的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_02_1_2_011_02:1_2_011_02_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4844b1264a84910af2343ee7ebb2cab948bb6d048b508616e38ee6548ff1bfcd",
      "text": "实用哭来表达高兴。说明超级开心！\n我也好开心♪蛋糕也要大家一起吃哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
